---

<section
	class="home-intro relative mx-auto max-w-7xl overflow-hidden px-4 pb-2 pt-5 md:px-8 md:pb-4 md:pt-6"
	aria-labelledby="home-intro-heading"
>
	<div
		class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-8 top-0 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-md-primary-container/50 blur-3xl md:h-48 md:w-48"
		aria-hidden="true"
	>
	</div>
	<div class="home-intro__inner relative">
		<p class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-md-primary">
			Kevin Hatchoua
		</p>
		<h1
			id="home-intro-heading"
			class="home-intro__title mt-2 font-display text-display-statement font-semibold leading-[1.1] text-md-on-surface"
		>
			Designing human experiences that are useful, usable, and used.
		</h1>
		<p class="home-intro__lead mt-4 max-w-2xl font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-md-on-surface-variant sm:text-lg">
			UX at Red Hat, teaching and boards by night, paint on the weekends. Welcome to the workbench.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
